            "icon": "check_mark",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "No cooking at all",
            "text": "<p>Not a pan, not an oven, not a kettle. The trout arrives hot-smoked and ready to eat, so this works on a boat, a beach or a countertop with the power out.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "g_time": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "time",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "About 25 minutes",
            "text": "<p>Almost all of it is slicing. Hollow the loaf, mix one spread, mash one mortar of basil, cut three vegetables thin, and layer.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "g_serves": {
          "type": "column",
