        "heading_size": "title-md",
        "heading_alignment": "text-left md:items-end md:flex-row",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>Built with Smoke in Chimneys Smoked Trout Filets &mdash; hot-smoked, ready to eat straight from the pack, no cooking step at all. A spoon of <a href=\"/products/lab-tested-salmon-roe-caviar\" title=\"Salmon Roe Caviar\">salmon roe</a> on top is not a bad idea, and a pinch of flaky spring salt is the last thing that goes on.</p>",
