    "game_plan": {
      "type": "timeline",
      "blocks": {
        "s_spread": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/smoked-trout-sandwich-scape-cheese-spread.jpg",
            "subheading": "Step 1",
            "heading": "Hollow the loaf, mix the scape cheese",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Split the sourdough lengthwise and pull out some of the crumb from both halves so there is room for the filling &mdash; keep the scooped bread for croutons or breadcrumbs. Fold finely chopped garlic scapes (or chives) through a cup of soft cheese and spread it in an even layer on <strong>both</strong> cut faces.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "s_trout": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/smoked-trout-sandwich-trout-layer-dill.jpg",
            "subheading": "Step 2",
            "heading": "Lay the trout edge to edge",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Flake or lay the smoked trout fillets flat across the bottom half so the coverage is even from end to end, then scatter a few sprigs of fresh dill straight onto the fish. The oil in hot-smoked trout is what carries the dill, so it goes on the fish rather than on the greens.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "s_basil": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/smoked-trout-sandwich-basil-mortar-pestle.jpg",
            "subheading": "Step 3",
            "heading": "Mash the basil in a mortar",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Basil into the mortar with 2 Tbsp of the olive oil, the lemon juice and salt to taste. Mash rather than blend &mdash; you want a rough, bright green oil with texture, not a smooth pesto. Spread it on the underside of the top half.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "s_veg": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/smoked-trout-sandwich-sliced-vegetables.jpg",
            "subheading": "Step 4",
            "heading": "Slice thin, season on the sandwich",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Tomato, cucumber and half a red onion, all sliced as thin as you can manage. Lay them over the trout and season there &mdash; cracked pepper, salt, the rest of the olive oil and lemon &mdash; rather than tossing them in a bowl first, which just leaves the dressing behind.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "s_close": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/smoked-trout-sandwich-loaded-open.jpg",
            "subheading": "Step 5",
            "heading": "Greens last, then the lid",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>A large handful of rainbow lettuce or spring mix and the remaining dill go on top of the wet layer, which keeps the lid dry. Close the sandwich, press it gently, then slice it and take it somewhere with a view.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "s_spread",
        "s_trout",
        "s_basil",
        "s_veg",
        "s_close"
      ],
